# Copy to .env in this directory — `prisma generate`/`migrate`/`studio` load
# it from here (there is no repo-root .env; each package/service that needs
# one has its own .env.example, same as this one).
#
# iecp_migrator: full DDL, needed for `migrate:dev`/`migrate:deploy`/`migrate:rollback`
# and `seed`. See infrastructure/postgres/init/02-roles.sql and
# docs/database/README.md#roles--least-privilege for what this role can and
# can't do, and why a second, more restricted role (iecp_app) exists for
# every running service instead of this one.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://iecp_migrator:change-me-migrator@localhost:5432/iecp?schema=public"
